---
import BaseLayout from 'theme/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy — TapToGen" description="Read TapToGen's Cookie Policy to understand how we use cookies, web beacons, and local browser storage to provide free generator tools." canonical="/cookies/">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span><span>Cookie Policy</span></div>
      <h1>Cookie <span class="gradient-text">Policy</span></h1>
      <p>Last updated: August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content-section" style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 0;">
      <h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small text files placed on your computer or mobile device when you visit a website. They are widely used to make websites work efficiently and provide essential reporting information.</p>
      
      <h2>2. How TapToGen Uses Cookies</h2>
      <p>TapToGen operates on a 100% client-side, privacy-first model. All tool inputs and generated outputs are processed locally in your browser session without being stored on remote servers.</p>
      <p>We use cookies and browser local storage for the following purposes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Required to remember your UI theme preferences, active language selection, and recent tool history session state.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics Cookies:</strong> We use Google Analytics (G-RRXK1L32WK) with IP anonymization to understand aggregate page views, popular generator tools, and user experience metrics.</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising Cookies:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google AdSense, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to our website or other websites on the internet.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Third-Party Advertising & DoubleClick Cookies</h2>
      <p>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to TapToGen.com and/or other sites on the Internet. Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--color-primary);">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--color-primary);">AboutAds.info</a>.</p>

      <h2>4. Managing and Disabling Cookies</h2>
      <p>You can control and manage cookie settings in your browser. Disabling cookies will not prevent you from using any of our 430+ free generator tools, as all processing runs locally inside your web browser via JavaScript.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Google Chrome: Settings &gt; Privacy and security &gt; Cookies and other site data</li>
        <li>Mozilla Firefox: Options &gt; Privacy &amp; Security &gt; Cookies and Site Data</li>
        <li>Apple Safari: Preferences &gt; Privacy &gt; Block all cookies</li>
        <li>Microsoft Edge: Settings &gt; Site permissions &gt; Cookies and site data</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions regarding our Cookie Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@taptogen.com" style="color: var(--color-accent-2);">contact@taptogen.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
